import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About AI Tool Hub" description="Who runs AI Tool Hub, how we test AI tools, and why you can trust our reviews.">
<article class="legal-page">
  <h1>About AI Tool Hub</h1>
  <p class="lede">AI Tool Hub is a curated directory of AI tools we have personally tested for 2+ weeks. We are not a list of every AI tool that exists - we only list the ones we would recommend.</p>
  <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
  <p>AI Tool Hub is run by a small team of writers, developers and designers who use AI tools daily for work. We started this site because existing AI tool directories were either (a) pay-to-play, (b) full of low-quality tools, or (c) obviously AI-generated without any real testing.</p>
  <h2>How we test</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Sign up</strong> using a fresh account, never a paid promotion.</li>
    <li><strong>Use the tool for 2+ weeks</strong> on real tasks in our actual work (writing, coding, designing).</li>
    <li><strong>Score</strong> on output quality, ease of use, pricing transparency, support quality, and privacy.</li>
    <li><strong>Re-test every 6 months</strong> - if a tool drops in quality, we drop it from the list.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>AI Tool Hub is supported by display advertising (Google AdSense) and a small number of clearly marked affiliate links. Affiliate links never affect our rankings.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Found a tool we missed? Found an error? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
</article>
</BaseLayout>
